Your journey to the south porch of the Erechtheion leads you to the site of the Caryatids. These larger than life women are not just statues; they are also the columns holding up the roof of this porch. You may already be familiar with these statuesque columns since a reproduction of one such Caryatid is located in Spurlock Museum at the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign.

Congratulations!!! You have solved the maze and completed your space-time adventure!!